{"id":"vod_bf_46250","vodId":"46250","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"重生计划","name_cn":"重生计划","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-47/ded09b46765b4b735777e434926ab1de.jpg"},"summary":"海崎新太（小野贤章 配音）的人生在二十七岁之时走入了死胡同之中，工作仅三个月就选择辞职，两次参加考研却均无功而返，想要找一个可以糊口的工作却屡屡失败受挫，新太不知道也不想知道，究竟还会有什么在未来等待着他。　　某日，新太失魂落魄的走在街头，偶然遇见了一位名叫夜明了（木村良平 配音）的神秘男子，并邀请他参加一个看起来极为不祥的实验。在巨大的利益诱惑和保证能够找到工作的承诺面前，满腹疑虑的新太产生了动摇。按照要求，新太将要服下一颗神秘的药丸，之后，他的外表将会回到十七岁的样子，新太需要进入高中三年级就读，整个实验为期一年。就这样，新太回到了校园之中，在这里，等待着他的会是怎样的生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:16:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhongshengjihua/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:48:49.625Z"}